{"sourceUrl":"https://dwyx.swu.edu.cn/info/1071/3897.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:26.815467+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://dwyx.swu.edu.cn/info/1071/3897.htm","html":"<div><div>\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span>西南大学热忱欢迎全国优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读我校硕士研究生！为做好接收2027年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读研究生（以下简称推免生）工作，我院将开展接收推免生预报名工作，欢迎广大推免生报名！</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>条件</span></span><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）具有推免资格的本科培养单位推荐的、具有免（初）试攻读研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>专业</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我院</span></span><span>在“西南大学2027年接收推免生预报名系统”（http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/）可</span><span><span>选报的</span></span><span><span>全日制硕士招生专业均可接收硕士推免生</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>最终以“教育部推免服务系统”填报专业为准</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、</span></span><span><span>报名和复试</span></span><span><span>程序</span></span><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>报名程序</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1、报名时间：2026年9月7日至9月15日（17:00前）。</span></p>\n<p><span>2、凡符合上述</span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>条件且有意愿报考我校的优秀应届本科毕业生（包括本校和外校），请于报名时间内登录“西南大学</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统”（http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/），</span></span><span><span>按要求上传相关材料</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>完成报名信息</span></span><span><span>提交</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名所需提交相关材料如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（1）</span></span><span><span>本人</span></span><span><span>学生证、第二代身份证正反面</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（2）</span></span><span><span>（若有）国家英语四、六级证书或成绩单复印件（复试时提供原件）；</span></span><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（3）（若有）发表论文的复印件（复试时提供原件）；</span></span><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（4）（若有）获奖证书或专利证书复印件（复试时提供原件）；</span></span><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>）个人简历（包括本科专业背景、学习和科研情况等）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>要求：上传文件按照顺序扫描或合并成1个pdf文件且大小不要超过8M。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为方便联系和通知，请参加预推免的考生加入QQ群：</span></span><span><span>1108072042</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>复试安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>将对</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>提交的所有材料进行审查</span></span><span><span>，择优确定</span></span><span><span>复试名单并发出通知，请考生及时关</span></span><span>注“西南大学2027年接收推免生预报名系统”站内消息并保持手机畅通。复试形式和内容、时间和地点等具体安排以学院</span><span><span>通知为准。</span></span><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>申请人提交的全部材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消其接收推免申请资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>已在我校</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>西南大学</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统”</span></span><span><span>预</span></span><span><span>报名的</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>届时还</span></span><span><span>应</span></span><span><span>通过教育部“全国推免服务系统”注册并填报志愿，</span></span><span><span>并在学院规定时间内</span></span><span><span>按工作程序完成招生流程</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>“全国推免服务系统”网址为：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/，预计9月下旬开放报名，请申请人关注中国研究生招生信息网和</span><span><span>学院官网</span></span><span><span>通知。</span></span><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>我校将根据教育部</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>最新推免政策</span></span><span><span>和学校相关文件要求</span></span><span><span>及时公布</span></span><span><span>西南</span></span><span><span>大学</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收推免生章程</span></span><span><span>及其他相关信息，</span></span><span><span>请</span></span><span><span>关注</span></span><span><span>西南大学研招网和学院官网</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span>                    </span></p>\n<p><span><span>2026年9月7日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> <span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://dwyx.swu.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://dwyx.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1837874397&amp;wbfileid=5857A08CEBB43CE6EFC3C5639C451BF0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1.西南大学2027年接收推免生预报名系统操作步骤（考生端）.docx</a></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"119c8301515841f639dd2fc45631202f49f0d9b56b2bfe0e35b903d5c31df2c8","textLength":1180,"sourceSha256":"4a306a77d391b121cc22fb90260cf9e323f19b2cfc22c17c4a731d8ed4e1e043","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a2b92f6bb8c3133e7cde","title":"2026年西南大学动物医学院关于接收2027年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读研究生的预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:26.815467+00:00"}
